<title>USA: Dodge City feeder steer prices mixed - USDA.</title>
<headline>Dodge City feeder steer prices mixed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with last week - Feeder steers 300-550 lbs steady in a light test; 550-1000 lbs 2.00-3.00 higher. Feeder heifers 300-500 lbs steady to weak; 500-950 lbs 1.00-3.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trade very active, demand very good. Receipts 84 percent 600 lbs and over; 11 percent 600 lbs and under; 05 percent cows and bulls with 300 early.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - (Figures in parentheses are weighted</p>
<p>average prices) Medium and Large 1 600-650 lbs 80.85-84.00</p>
<p>(82.44); 650-700 lbs 77.00-81.75 (80.59); 700-750 lbs</p>
<p>77.00-81.25 (80.25); 750-800 lbs 76.90-78.75 (78.04); 800-850</p>
<p>lbs 74.85-79.00 (76.42); 850-900 lbs 73.00-77.00 (75.54);</p>
<p>900-950 lbs 70.75-74.75 (72.70); 34 head 995 lbs 68.00. Full</p>
<p>and/or fleshy 600-650 lbs 76.50-77.75 (77.38); 14 head 705 lbs</p>
<p>74.50. Steers and bulls 11 head 390 lbs 84.00; 400-450 lbs</p>
<p>84.00-88.00 (85.19); 13 head 468 lbs 85.00. Bulls 10 head 630</p>
<p>lbs 74.50; 20 head 707 lbs 75.00. Medium and Large 1-2 15 head</p>
<p>666 lbs 70.50; 700-750 lbs 73.50-75.25 (74.92); 800- 850 lbs</p>
<p>73.25-74.90 (74.40). Large 2 Holsteins - 4 head 820 lbs 56.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 600-650 lbs 75.00-77.75</p>
<p>(76.54); 650-700 lbs 73.00-75.75 (75.06); 700-750 lbs</p>
<p>72.85-76.35 (74.95); 750-800 lbs 72.00-75.00 (73.34); 37 head</p>
<p>816 lbs 73.40; 17 head 899 lbs 70.75; 900-950 lbs 66.50-70.00</p>
<p>(68.59). Medium and Large 1-2 500-550 lbs 65.50-76.50 (71.61);</p>
<p>600-650 lbs 73.00- 73.50 (73.27); 22 head 678 lbs 70.75;</p>
<p>700-750 lbs 71.25-72.25 (71.70).</p>
<p>Receipts - 5,820  Last Week - 4,868  Last Year - 3,432</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
